text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Structural reliability"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"71b42395-de66-452d-93e5-ab75e18cf740","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Use locally sourced materials in application environment"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"e3fe4ffa-0ea3-4fd7-b8e3-19b86746e6f9","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"[Speaker Notes] Will The TRL is 6-7 and there is an MVP for this 3D printer, but as we have not done We want it to stay quick and easy: so moving needs to be easy and using the thing should be easy. Lower for cheaper to build and transport, Cumbersome\n**bc this is what customers want, this is why we’re devleopin this way"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.217Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"525dd61b-f75c-4800-8d4a-fd9557977b3f","type":"heading","style":{},"content":{"text":"Gantt Chart","level":2},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"3e3ee79d-f54c-48d5-b9cc-6e5794e2eebd","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"‹#›"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"965fb359-8eb7-4422-99dd-9db9380338cd","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"[Speaker Notes] Will - Need minimal r&amp;d to change the plans of device, most of time will be creating initial protoype using papent and plans\nStart first sales month 18-19, Third party performance validation month 14-15\nIdk if you see the notes but I took best guesses about this. The dude never emailed me back yet, but it would likely be 8-12 months before we had one printer with changes to do MVP and stuff\nThe problem: it will take a while to have R&amp;D and first printer done. Gantt chart of project w key milestones\nMilestones\n1 design development requirements:\n2 design custom parts, order commercial off the shelf parts (COTS)\n3 is the tech/software package integrated sensors and systems\n4 fabricate the prototype system( build the damn thing),\n5 scaled testing (can we print a box),\n6 iterate on design and fix it,\n7 full scale demonstration and third party performance validation- have a contractor drill holes, bang a hammer against it\n8 identifying vendors to scale manufacturing, who are we buying each part from- build partnerships\n9 we will take IP from army but since we develop it, we will need to make our own unique IP"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.223Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"649595b8-3b14-4aea-a97e-dfb39e6afeab","type":"heading","style":{},"content":{"text":"Commercialization Strategy","level":2},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"8a649f4e-4db9-4560-a744-c8653f5a1c2e","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Market Characteristics"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"774576bb-79c6-4dc4-a23f-88d3eacfc8ea","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Proof-based adoption"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"60c36302-769d-4290-bb58-2232257e840a","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Local, fragmented buyers"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"de800f52-1f5a-4d82-b292-ad87b577d99f","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Barriers: trust, portability, and cost"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"653b8b30-86ae-49db-b8c9-a442ecfd68b6","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Fits current subcontractor workflow"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.225Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"6fc5d8a8-a4