Will: Can be tech expert chief technology officer; I can’t lead r&amp;d but id e decent person to make sure they are on track kinda? Like I can understand it but only the companies have the experience and capability for thedevelopment. So tech oversight works ya
“Construction attorney with experience in building code compliance and alternative construction methods.”
Our team is smaller than most here and limited in expertise when it comes to construction and 3D printers so we will need a legal advisor to ensure our structures are up to code and that general contractors trust the structural integrity of our 3D printer’s work. We will also need help with fundraising as costs for creating the first printer is high. We will need a technician to learn the mechanics of the machine to fix when it needs repair. Lastly, we are looking for advice from a homebuilder. We have experience with construction and general engineering, but we do not have a civil engineer or homebuilder who can help us create and validate our work.', '[{"id":"90a65c3d-5c23-4df3-a602-f6fc601ce22a","type":"heading","style":{},"content":{"text":"Management Team","level":2},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.233Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.233Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"f12aa26e-d026-42d7-b3b7-1cc67f47aa76","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"‹#›"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.233Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.233Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"73e13294-5a9f-46cb-a33a-79dd5aa1d798","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Kate Ulepic"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.234Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.234Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"498ec108-0f22-4f8f-8a87-bef72fbe467b","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Chief Executive Officer"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:39:46.234Z","actor_name"